      {
        "id": 17440,
        "title": "Index",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 147896,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Lass uns tiefer in die Werte eintauchen, die ein Array speichern kann, und wie wir sie aktualisieren können. So wie ein Spiel-HUD möglicherweise Spielerstatistiken während eines Levels verfolgt.</p><webview version=\"2\" content=\"&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html lang=&quot;en&quot;&gt;&#xA;&lt;head&gt;&#xA;    &lt;meta charset=&quot;UTF-8&quot;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;meta name=&quot;viewport&quot; content=&quot;width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0&quot;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;title&gt;Game HUD&lt;/title&gt;&#xA;    &lt;style&gt;&#xA;        body {&#xA;            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&#xA;            display: flex;&#xA;            justify-content: center;&#xA;            align-items: center;&#xA;            margin: 24px auto;&#xA;            background: radial-gradient(circle at top, #1a2a3a, #0b1220);&#xA;            color: #fff;&#xA;        }&#xA;        .hud {&#xA;            background-color: rgba(30, 144, 255, 0.15);&#xA;            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);&#xA;            border-radius: 10px;&#xA;            box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);&#xA;            padding: 18px;&#xA;            width: 320px;&#xA;            text-align: center;&#xA;        }&#xA;        .hud-title {&#xA;            font-size: 20px;&#xA;            margin-bottom: 14px;&#xA;        }&#xA;        .tabs {&#xA;            display: flex;&#xA;            justify-content: space-around;&#xA;            gap: 8px;&#xA;            margin-bottom: 14px;&#xA;        }&#xA;        .tab {&#xA;            cursor: pointer;&#xA;            padding: 10px;&#xA;            border-radius: 8px;&#xA;            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);&#xA;            user-select: none;&#xA;            flex: 1;&#xA;        }&#xA;        .tab.active {&#xA;            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.22);&#xA;        }&#xA;        .panel {&#xA;            font-size: 14px;&#xA;        }&#xA;        .row {&#xA;            display: flex;&#xA;            justify-content: space-between;&#xA;            gap: 8px;&#xA;            margin-bottom: 10px;&#xA;        }&#xA;        .cell {&#xA;            flex: 1;&#xA;            text-align: center;&#xA;            padding: 8px 6px;&#xA;            border-radius: 8px;&#xA;            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);&#xA;        }&#xA;        .label {&#xA;            opacity: 0.85;&#xA;            font-size: 12px;&#xA;            display: block;&#xA;            margin-top: 4px;&#xA;        }&#xA;    &lt;/style&gt;&#xA;&lt;/head&gt;&#xA;&lt;body&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&quot;hud&quot;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;div class=&quot;hud-title&quot;&gt;Level 1 HUD&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;        &lt;div class=&quot;tabs&quot;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;div class=&quot;tab active&quot; data-panel=&quot;1&quot;&gt;🧍 Player&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;            &lt;div class=&quot;tab&quot; data-panel=&quot;2&quot;&gt;👾 Enemies&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;            &lt;div class=&quot;tab&quot; data-panel=&quot;3&quot;&gt;🎒 Inventory&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;        &lt;div class=&quot;panel&quot;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;div class=&quot;row&quot; data-panel=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&#xA;                &lt;div class=&quot;cell&quot;&gt;100&lt;span class=&quot;label&quot;&gt;Health&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;                &lt;div class=&quot;cell&quot;&gt;0&lt;span class=&quot;label&quot;&gt;Score&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;                &lt;div class=&quot;cell&quot;&gt;1&lt;span class=&quot;label&quot;&gt;Lives&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;            &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;            &lt;div class=&quot;row&quot; data-panel=&quot;2&quot; style=&quot;display: none;&quot;&gt;&#xA;                &lt;div class=&quot;cell&quot;&gt;3&lt;span class=&quot;label&quot;&gt;Slimes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;                &lt;div class=&quot;cell&quot;&gt;1&lt;span class=&quot;label&quot;&gt;Bats&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;                &lt;div class=&quot;cell&quot;&gt;0&lt;span class=&quot;label&quot;&gt;Boss&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;            &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;            &lt;div class=&quot;row&quot; data-panel=&quot;3&quot; style=&quot;display: none;&quot;&gt;&#xA;                &lt;div class=&quot;cell&quot;&gt;🗡️&lt;span class=&quot;label&quot;&gt;Sword&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;                &lt;div class=&quot;cell&quot;&gt;🧪&lt;span class=&quot;label&quot;&gt;Potion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;                &lt;div class=&quot;cell&quot;&gt;🗝️&lt;span class=&quot;label&quot;&gt;Key&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;            &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;    &lt;script&gt;&#xA;        document.addEventListener(&quot;DOMContentLoaded&quot;, function() {&#xA;            const tabs = document.querySelectorAll(&quot;.tab&quot;);&#xA;            const panels = document.querySelectorAll(&quot;.panel .row&quot;);&#xA;&#xA;            tabs.forEach(tab =&gt; {&#xA;                tab.addEventListener(&quot;click&quot;, function() {&#xA;                    tabs.forEach(t =&gt; t.classList.remove(&quot;active&quot;));&#xA;                    this.classList.add(&quot;active&quot;);&#xA;&#xA;                    const panel = this.getAttribute(&quot;data-panel&quot;);&#xA;                    panels.forEach(row =&gt; {&#xA;                        if (row.getAttribute(&quot;data-panel&quot;) === panel) {&#xA;                            row.style.display = &quot;flex&quot;;&#xA;                        } else {&#xA;                            row.style.display = &quot;none&quot;;&#xA;                        }&#xA;                    });&#xA;                });&#xA;            });&#xA;        });&#xA;    &lt;/script&gt;&#xA;&lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 147897,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ein Array kann verschiedene Spielerstatistiken speichern und wird aktualisiert, während die Spielschleife während eines Levels läuft.</p><webview version=\"2\" content=\"&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html lang=&quot;en&quot;&gt;&#xA;&lt;head&gt;&#xA;    &lt;meta charset=&quot;UTF-8&quot;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;meta name=&quot;viewport&quot; content=&quot;width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0&quot;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;title&gt;Game HUD&lt;/title&gt;&#xA;    &lt;style&gt;&#xA;        body {&#xA;            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&#xA;            display: flex;&#xA;            justify-content: center;&#xA;            align-items: center;&#xA;            margin: 24px auto;&#xA;            background: radial-gradient(circle at top, #1a2a3a, #0b1220);&#xA;            color: #fff;&#xA;        }&#xA;        .hud {&#xA;            background-color: rgba(30, 144, 255, 0.15);&#xA;            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);&#xA;            border-radius: 10px;&#xA;            box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);&#xA;            padding: 18px;&#xA;            width: 320px;&#xA;            text-align: center;&#xA;        }&#xA;        .hud-title {&#xA;            font-size: 20px;&#xA;            margin-bottom: 14px;&#xA;        }&#xA;        .tabs {&#xA;            display: flex;&#xA;            justify-content: space-around;&#xA;            gap: 8px;&#xA;            margin-bottom: 14px;&#xA;        }&#xA;        .tab {&#xA;            cursor: pointer;&#xA;            padding: 10px;&#xA;            border-radius: 8px;&#xA;            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);&#xA;            user-select: none;&#xA;            flex: 1;&#xA;        }&#xA;        .tab.active {&#xA;            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.22);&#xA;        }&#xA;        .panel {&#xA;            font-size: 14px;&#xA;        }&#xA;        .row {&#xA;            display: flex;&#xA;            justify-content: space-between;&#xA;            gap: 8px;&#xA;            margin-bottom: 10px;&#xA;        }&#xA;        .cell {&#xA;            flex: 1;&#xA;            text-align: center;&#xA;            padding: 8px 6px;&#xA;            border-radius: 8px;&#xA;            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);&#xA;        }&#xA;        .label {&#xA;            opacity: 0.85;&#xA;            font-size: 12px;&#xA;            display: block;&#xA;            margin-top: 4px;&#xA;        }&#xA;    &lt;/style&gt;&#xA;&lt;/head&gt;&#xA;&lt;body&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&quot;hud&quot;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;div class=&quot;hud-title&quot;&gt;Level 1 HUD&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;        &lt;div class=&quot;tabs&quot;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;div class=&quot;tab active&quot; data-panel=&quot;1&quot;&gt;🧍 Player&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;            &lt;div class=&quot;tab&quot; data-panel=&quot;2&quot;&gt;👾 Enemies&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;            &lt;div class=&quot;tab&quot; data-panel=&quot;3&quot;&gt;🎒 Inventory&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;        &lt;div class=&quot;panel&quot;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;div class=&quot;row&quot; data-panel=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&#xA;                &lt;div class=&quot;cell&quot;&gt;100&lt;span class=&quot;label&quot;&gt;Health&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;                &lt;div class=&quot;cell&quot;&gt;0&lt;span class=&quot;label&quot;&gt;Score&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;                &lt;div class=&quot;cell&quot;&gt;1&lt;span class=&quot;label&quot;&gt;Lives&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;            &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;            &lt;div class=&quot;row&quot; data-panel=&quot;2&quot; style=&quot;display: none;&quot;&gt;&#xA;                &lt;div class=&quot;cell&quot;&gt;3&lt;span class=&quot;label&quot;&gt;Slimes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;                &lt;div class=&quot;cell&quot;&gt;1&lt;span class=&quot;label&quot;&gt;Bats&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;                &lt;div class=&quot;cell&quot;&gt;0&lt;span class=&quot;label&quot;&gt;Boss&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;            &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;            &lt;div class=&quot;row&quot; data-panel=&quot;3&quot; style=&quot;display: none;&quot;&gt;&#xA;                &lt;div class=&quot;cell&quot;&gt;🗡️&lt;span class=&quot;label&quot;&gt;Sword&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;                &lt;div class=&quot;cell&quot;&gt;🧪&lt;span class=&quot;label&quot;&gt;Potion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;                &lt;div class=&quot;cell&quot;&gt;🗝️&lt;span class=&quot;label&quot;&gt;Key&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;            &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;    &lt;script&gt;&#xA;        document.addEventListener(&quot;DOMContentLoaded&quot;, function() {&#xA;            const tabs = document.querySelectorAll(&quot;.tab&quot;);&#xA;            const panels = document.querySelectorAll(&quot;.panel .row&quot;);&#xA;&#xA;            tabs.forEach(tab =&gt; {&#xA;                tab.addEventListener(&quot;click&quot;, function() {&#xA;                    tabs.forEach(t =&gt; t.classList.remove(&quot;active&quot;));&#xA;                    this.classList.add(&quot;active&quot;);&#xA;&#xA;                    const panel = this.getAttribute(&quot;data-panel&quot;);&#xA;                    panels.forEach(row =&gt; {&#xA;                        if (row.getAttribute(&quot;data-panel&quot;) === panel) {&#xA;                            row.style.display = &quot;flex&quot;;&#xA;                        } else {&#xA;                            row.style.display = &quot;none&quot;;&#xA;                        }&#xA;                    });&#xA;                });&#xA;            });&#xA;        });&#xA;    &lt;/script&gt;&#xA;&lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 147898,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Stell dir ein Array wie eine Inventarleiste vor. Ein Slot kann jede Variable oder jeden Wert speichern, sei es ein String, Boolean oder eine Zahl wie <code>100</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;100&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"24\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerStats = [\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;warrior&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>100</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 147899,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jedes Element in einem Array hat eine nummerierte Position, die als Index bezeichnet wird.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 147900,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Indizes beginnen bei 0 und erhöhen sich mit jedem weiteren Wert. Das bedeutet, dass das zweite Element in <code>playerStats</code> an Index <code>1</code> ist. Code diesen Index.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"72\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerStats = [\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;warrior&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerStats[\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Gib <code>1</code> ein.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 147901,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Um auf ein Element wie den <code>true</code>-Wert zuzugreifen, gib den Array-Namen <code>playerStats</code> gefolgt vom Index des Elements in eckigen Klammern <code>[2]</code> ein.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"73\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerStats = [\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;warrior&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerStats[\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>playerStats</code>, gefolgt von <code>[</code> und schließlich <code>2</code>, <code>]</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 147902,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Um den Wert am zweiten Index zu aktualisieren, greife darauf zu durch <code>playerStats[2]</code>, und verwende dann <code>=</code>, um ihm einen neuen Wert wie <code>false</code> zuzuweisen.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"69\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerStats = [\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;warrior&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerStats[\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerStats);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>playerStats[2]</code>, gefolgt von <code>=</code> und schließlich <code>false</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 147903,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Obwohl das Array vier Elemente hat, ist der letzte Index, auf den wir zugreifen können, <code>3</code>, da das Indexieren bei 0 beginnt.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"4\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"61\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerStats = [\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;warrior&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerStats[\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] = \" /><text value=\"&quot;mage&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerStats);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>3</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 147904,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Welche Arten von Werten kann ein Array speichern?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Jeder Wert, einschließlich Strings, Zahlen und Booleans</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Nur Strings</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Jeder Wert, einschließlich Strings, Zahlen und Booleans.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 147905,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wie nennen wir die Position eines Elements in einem Array?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Der Index des Elements</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Die Nummer des Elements</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Der Index des Elements.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 147906,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Welchen Index hat das Element in diesem Array?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>0</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>0</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 147907,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wie greifen wir auf ein Element in diesem Array zu?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" loot = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;coin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;gem&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;potion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>loot[1]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>loot[\"gem\"]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>loot[1]</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 147908,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wie aktualisieren wir einen Wert in einem Array?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Wir greifen auf den Wert über seinen Index zu und weisen dann einen anderen Wert zu</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Wir können Werte in Arrays nicht aktualisieren</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wir greifen auf den Wert über seinen Index zu und weisen dann einen anderen Wert zu.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 147909,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Welche Indizes können wir in einem Array mit zwei Elementen zugreifen?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>0</code> und <code>1</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code> und <code>2</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>0</code> und <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 147910,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Code den Wert <code>false</code> in dieses Array.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"32\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" gameOptions = [\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Gib <code>false</code> ein.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #16",
            "id": 147911,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Stelle sicher, dass <code>\"sword\"</code> an Index <code>0</code> und <code>\"shield\"</code> an Index <code>1</code> ist, indem du <code>\"sword\"</code> und dann <code>\"shield\"</code> codierst.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;bow&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"36\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" equipment = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;sword&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;shield&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(equipment);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>\"sword\"</code>, gefolgt von <code>\"shield\"</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #17",
            "id": 147912,
            "contentType": "interactive",
